{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a532d9ad107e48918dc88a7e089de3cb29a1750f54b4726289bf750b068d563a","ja":"選んだプレゼントは","zh":"选的礼物是","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1903a66f410709d382df6d0ffb1bad6a27bf6352356f51d3df24d9e919eadd5c","ja":"……ごめんなさい、春香さん。\n悩みすぎて、ちょっと混乱しちゃいました。","zh":"……对不起，春香小姐。\n我想得太多，脑子有点乱了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"68be169ab8bb668b6e33870ee29f05cea8aba585d6820f0adb110f60a5e5c0a6","ja":"それに、こんなに時間がかかってるのに、\nまだ決められなくって……。","zh":"而且，明明花了这么多时间，\n却还是做不了决定……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3823e5bbf000d93dc83e92e84ecb58c11337f84434487a4cb8fe2c7676898ff7","ja":"全然大丈夫だよ！　大事なプレゼントだから、\n迷って当然だもん。私も一緒に見られて楽しかったし。","zh":"完全没关系啦！因为是很重要的礼物，\n会犹豫也是理所当然的嘛。而且我也很高兴能陪你一起看。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6c9a1b0b3d0bc14d22b77a69a041ba2726e39978bf5144044d7e29c4579d47c9","ja":"それに、こんなに美味しいオレンジのムースが\n食べられたのは、星梨花ちゃんのおかげだよ♪","zh":"而且，能吃到这么美味的橙子慕斯，\n多亏了星梨花呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"35d7bbfd7c5e9607242cd5f8e68adb02e7815a0154751eaa899f2813de283411","ja":"よかったら、一口どうぞ♪","zh":"不介意的话，请尝一口吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"07381b81472919241ec27d28a2c65b17377ed960bc039e3b77c56651c3d394f2","ja":"ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃあ、わたしのショートケーキも、どうぞ♪","zh":"谢谢您！\n那我的草莓蛋糕也请您尝尝吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b6028d8ba5f29d77d8ce839991a5e5077a854c4ef3c9398b6214744c1bc1e8be","ja":"……えへへっ♪　すっごく楽しいですね♪","zh":"……嘿嘿♪　真的好开心呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"dfa50900bbef298ae0273dd1bfdec1f14cb2d230c591226422717caea24798e8","ja":"パパにも、こんな気持ちになってもらえる\nプレゼントができたらいんですけど……。","zh":"要是也能送爸爸一份\n让他体会到这种心情的礼物就好了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"21b67b384b3234b892bf645fe0d6294d30524f3f3210f6b8a33c970ec78cb60c","ja":"……あっ！　ねえ、星梨花ちゃん。プレゼントって、\n物じゃなくてもいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"……啊！那个，星梨花。礼物这种东西，\n不一定非得是实物吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"474697a08d00e145da10d0c6feafaeb91f7ee1723c74160c980fa1e988307f34","ja":"ほら、今みたいに、\nお父さんをお茶に誘ってみるとか。","zh":"比如像现在这样，\n试着邀请爸爸一起喝茶。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"68739f892c6b42e4c5f11cf98cade13c4173a43596aa91484194412ff2db4cee","ja":"ティータイムがプレゼント……ですか？","zh":"下午茶时间是……礼物吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"39a6c283832b18d8996b5799f3b2c85955f69fed73e0c25e7de562acdca85171","ja":"うん。星梨花ちゃんといっしょにお茶ができたら、\nきっと、お父さんも幸せな気持ちになれると思うよ。","zh":"嗯。要是能和小星梨花一起喝茶，\n爸爸的心情也一定会感到很幸福的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1c6317b9f679b65749871a2afda3c36a3f9e0e87b3005bac992c658730e5606d","ja":"だって、私が今、星梨花ちゃんとお茶してて、\nすっごく幸せだから♪","zh":"因为我现在能和星梨花一起喝下午茶，\n觉得超级幸福嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"57f15bb6af19eba38bcc449a68a4975eef32d3b8b4fb5ccdd8a224481e903caf","ja":"春香さん……えへへ、ありがとうございます！\nそっか、プレゼントっていろいろあるんですね。","zh":"春香小姐……嘿嘿，谢谢您！\n原来是这样，礼物也有很多种呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9205f1b89fccbc9753b532524b22e9f96473705c97bca02b507493d6f08b937a","ja":"それじゃあ今日の夜、さっそく誘ってみます！","zh":"那今天晚上我就立刻去邀请看看！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1761.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"8f67bc5abf2e933d97d34a0940e1126b9c91090a4c084fc59553c8c951816e1a","ja":"うん！\n素敵な時間を過ごせますように♪","zh":"嗯！\n愿能度过一段美好的时光♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
